{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toss. Aim. Score. Urban Style.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Disc Golf City Demo</strong>, an arcade-inspired disc golf game where the concrete jungle becomes your playground. Whether you're curving a disc through alleyways or banking a trick shot off a rooftop, every course is packed with stylish scenery and sneaky targets.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>Demo version</strong> lets you play the <strong>first two courses</strong> in the city \u2014 the perfect introduction to Disc Golf City\u2019s mix of relaxed play and tricky trick shots. The full game expands beyond these courses with many more locations to master.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate city parks, plazas, and rooftops in this low-poly 3D world, all while unlocking bonus achievements for hitting signs, bins, and hidden targets in your path.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4f <strong>Arcade-style disc golf</strong> set in a familiar city environment</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Hit the basket</strong>... or go for <strong>bonus trick shot targets</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized low-poly 3D visuals</strong> with a colorful city vibe</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Demo includes 2 full courses</strong> \u2014 more available in the full game</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 <strong>Family-friendly gameplay</strong> for all ages</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple to play, challenging to master</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Relaxing single-player experience</strong> with no timers and no stress</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985970?t=1757862121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.st